[6G##[9GMulti-Agent[21GPhase[27GCoordination

[6GThis[11Gskill[17Gparticipates[30Gin[33Gcooperative[45Gphase[51Gownership[61Gacross[68GSB-bearing
[6Gcoding[13Gagents[20G(Claude-SB,[32GForge-SB,[42GCodex-SB,[52GOpenCode-SB).[66GAt[69Gany[73Gtime,
[6Geach[11Gphase[17Gunder[23G`.planning/phases/<NNN>/`[49Gis[52Gowned[58Gby[61G**exactly[71Gone
[6Gruntime**.[17GThe[21GForge[27Gruntime[35Gcooperates[46Gvia[50Gthree[56Gcustom[63Gagents[70Gthat[75Gwrap
[6Gthe[10Gshared[17G`.planning/scripts/phase-lock.sh`[51Ghelper.

[6G**At[11Gphase[17Gentry**[25G(immediately[38Gafter[44Gthe[48Gphase[54Gnumber[61Gis[64Gresolved[73G—
[6Gtypically[16Gafter[22G`/gsd-discuss-phase`[43Gor[46G`/gsd-plan-phase`):

[6G```
[6GSkill(agent="forge-claim-phase",[39Gargs="<NNN>|<short-intent-string>")
