[6G-[8GOn[11G`CLAIMED:`[22G→[24Gproceed.
[6G-[8GOn[11G`BLOCKED:`[22G→[24GSTOP[29Gand[33Gsurface[41Gthe[45Gmessage[53Gto[56Gthe[60Guser.[66GAnother[74Gruntime
[6Gowns[11Gthe[15Gphase.[22GThe[26Guser[31Gmust[36Gwait[41Gfor[45Gthe[49Gother[55Gruntime[63Gto[66Gfinish,[74Gor[77Guse
[6G`/forge-delegate`[24G(Phase[31G73+)[36Gto[39Gdelegate[48Gthis[53Gwork[58Gto[61Gthe[65Gowning[72Gruntime.
[6G-[8GOn[11G`ALLOW[18G(inherited)`[31G/[33G`ALLOW[40G(no[44Ghelper)`[53G→[55Gproceed[63G(delegated
[6Gsubagent[15Gor[18Gnon-multi-agent[34Gproject).

[6G**During[15Glong-running[28Gsteps**[36G(gsd-execute-phase[55Gper[59Gwave,[65Ggsd-verify-work
[6Gper[10Gpass,[16Gany[20Goperation[30G>[32G5[34Gmin):

