[6G-[8GOn[11G`HEARTBEAT-OK:`[27G→[29Gcontinue.
[6G-[8GOn[11G`WARN:[18Gphase[24G<NNN>[30Gnot[34Gowned[40Gby[43Gthis[48Gruntime/host`[62G→[64Ganother[72Gruntime
[6Gstole[12Gthe[16Glock[21Gduring[28Ga[30Gstale-TTL[40Gwindow.[48GSTOP[53Gand[57Gre-claim[66Gbefore
[6Gcontinuing.

[6G**At[11Gphase[17Gexit**[24G(after[31G`/gsd-ship`[43Gfor[47Gthe[51Gphase,[58Gor[61Gbefore[68Ghanding[76Goff
[6Gto[9Gthe[13Gnext[18Gphase):

